WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 33

01:39.370 --> 01:41.110
Smash it at critical moment.

01:41.130 --> 01:42.840
It won't take any lives

01:42.860 --> 01:44.960
or hurt anyone physically,

01:45.050 --> 01:46.730
but even Great Masters

01:46.730 --> 01:48.410
will sleep quite a while from it.

01:48.770 --> 01:49.670
Thank you, Teacher!

01:49.690 --> 01:50.880
No problem.

01:51.300 --> 01:52.810
Just don't show off with it.

02:08.440 --> 02:10.030
=Si Lili, courtesan of Joy Tsin House=

02:19.820 --> 02:21.120
The little emperor clearly requires

02:21.140 --> 02:24.000
to send Si Lili back to Beiqi.

02:25.060 --> 02:27.560
Do they have any private relationship?

02:34.490 --> 02:36.000
Don't stare at her!

02:36.090 --> 02:37.520
The curtain is specially made.

02:37.540 --> 02:39.280
She can't hear what we're talking about.

02:39.540 --> 02:41.240
It doesn't make sense.

02:41.260 --> 02:42.420
If the little emperor

02:42.420 --> 02:43.450
really has a private relationship with her,

02:43.450 --> 02:44.730
why did he send her to the capital city

02:44.730 --> 02:46.170
as a secret agent?

03:21.080 --> 03:23.630
=Investigator's Office=

03:26.730 --> 03:28.170
Here comes Xiao En.

03:53.120 --> 03:55.440
=Xiao En, former Head of the Beiqi agents=

03:55.440 --> 03:57.480
The smell of sunlight.

03:59.930 --> 04:02.890
Go! Go! Hurry!

04:08.980 --> 04:10.530
Do you have family?

04:10.700 --> 04:12.610
Tell them to stay alive.

04:12.700 --> 04:14.610
I will find them.

04:14.700 --> 04:16.630
It's your luck to get out.

04:16.650 --> 04:19.350
Don't irritate the descendants at this time.

04:19.370 --> 04:21.160
You'll regret it

04:21.210 --> 04:22.170
if he kills you by mistake.

04:22.170 --> 04:23.370
If I'm killed,

04:23.370 --> 04:25.250
so will be you son.

04:26.330 --> 04:28.250
You'll regret that.

04:28.460 --> 04:31.850
Then stay alive and stop flaunting.

04:32.140 --> 04:35.370
Otherwise the Investigator's Office will catch you again.

04:38.140 --> 04:39.810
Chen Pingping!

04:42.980 --> 04:45.370
Fei Jie!

04:46.300 --> 04:48.600
You are still alive.

04:49.580 --> 04:51.370
Very good!

04:52.370 --> 04:53.610
I prayed in there that

04:53.610 --> 04:55.530
you can live a long life

04:56.050 --> 04:57.540
so that I can still have the chance of finding you.

04:57.540 --> 04:58.260
I'll make you dumb with my poison

04:58.260 --> 04:59.280
if you keep talking rubbish.

04:59.300 --> 05:00.850
Try it!

05:03.210 --> 05:05.160
My son was poisoned to death

05:05.770 --> 05:07.970
by you in the end.

05:09.020 --> 05:10.760
What was the poison?

05:11.770 --> 05:13.160
Do you still have it?

05:19.300 --> 05:20.610
What are you laughing at?

05:20.610 --> 05:22.000
What is he laughing at?

05:22.020 --> 05:24.160
I'm laughing at your legs.

05:25.860 --> 05:27.850
They're destroyed by me.

05:29.490 --> 05:32.410
I thought you are laughing at yourself.

05:32.930 --> 05:35.090
As a loser being imprisoned in jail

05:35.090 --> 05:36.720
for so many years

05:37.260 --> 05:38.920
who couldn't move an inch,

05:39.170 --> 05:41.200
do you feel very comfortable?

05:49.140 --> 05:50.640
Hold him!

05:52.260 --> 05:54.040
You're old now.

05:54.170 --> 05:55.800
Control your temper

05:55.820 --> 05:57.410
and care for your own health.

05:59.820 --> 06:02.250
Do you really let me go back?

06:03.700 --> 06:05.640
Do you really want to stay?

06:06.140 --> 06:08.130
You'll regret it.

06:14.650 --> 06:17.350
He is Fan Xian, Director-General of the Investigator's Office.

06:17.370 --> 06:18.760
He'll escort you.

06:20.020 --> 06:23.320
Nice to see you, Senor Xiao. How are you doing?

06:23.890 --> 06:25.070
Are you going to escort me?

06:25.090 --> 06:26.120
Yup!

06:26.140 --> 06:27.760
Who are these people to you?

06:28.210 --> 06:29.560
Master Fei is my teacher.

06:29.580 --> 06:30.960
The Head is my senior friend.

06:30.980 --> 06:32.810
They all treat me like families.

06:32.860 --> 06:35.040
Take a good look at this kid.

06:35.330 --> 06:37.320
This will be your last chance.

06:37.460 --> 06:39.140
You should take a good look at this yard,

06:39.140 --> 06:40.920
as you may come back again in the future.

06:45.930 --> 06:50.070
Be careful on the way. You're still too young.

06:50.090 --> 06:51.760
I'll learn from you.

07:07.980 --> 07:09.350
Fan Xian,

07:09.370 --> 07:11.310
the mission and your carriage

07:11.330 --> 07:13.640
are meeting you outside the city.

07:13.930 --> 07:14.910
Thank you!

07:14.930 --> 07:16.150
Please trust me.

07:16.170 --> 07:17.300
I'll surely bring your son back safely

07:17.300 --> 07:19.040
to the capital city.

07:24.820 --> 07:26.250
Fan Xian,

07:26.580 --> 07:28.310
let's go! I'll walk you there.

07:28.330 --> 07:29.680
You go first.

07:29.700 --> 07:31.440
I need to talk to him in private.

07:48.740 --> 07:51.010
Send your teacher back early.

07:51.260 --> 07:52.880
He's got injury on his body.

07:54.700 --> 07:56.130
What?

07:56.210 --> 07:57.810
He had a sticky fight

07:58.210 --> 08:01.480
against the Embroidered Uniform
Guards of Shen Zhong in Beiqi.

08:01.700 --> 08:03.870
Upon hearing that you're going to Beiqi,

08:03.890 --> 08:05.480
he rode the horse for 800 miles

08:05.860 --> 08:07.350
to get back to the capital city

08:07.370 --> 08:09.880
and experienced six assassinations,

08:11.140 --> 08:12.810
but he didn't stop for any single minute.

08:13.580 --> 08:15.720
He wasn't like this in the past.

08:17.330 --> 08:18.760
Your appearance

08:20.580 --> 08:22.440
changed us both.

08:23.610 --> 08:24.610
He should take a rest.

08:24.610 --> 08:25.880
Let me get him back.

08:27.540 --> 08:29.190
Go to the Taiping Residence.

08:29.210 --> 08:30.720
Someone wants to see you.

08:54.680 --> 08:58.470
=Taiping Residence=

09:09.700 --> 09:11.950
It could have not been you

09:11.970 --> 09:14.200
to lead the mission to Beiqi this time.

09:14.220 --> 09:16.130
Then why is it me in the end?

09:17.020 --> 09:20.000
You're young. You should take up the challenge

09:20.020 --> 09:21.960
to cultivate your mind and intelligence.

09:22.260 --> 09:25.330
Your Majesty think I have mental defects?

09:27.460 --> 09:29.510
Do you know

09:29.530 --> 09:31.030
what the missions are this time?

09:31.050 --> 09:33.040
I heard there are a few,

09:33.660 --> 09:34.850
but I am only told

09:34.850 --> 09:36.680
to get Yan Bingyun back.

09:36.700 --> 09:38.600
Nothing else.

09:39.340 --> 09:40.470
Are my missions

09:40.490 --> 09:42.570
assigned by Your Majesty in person?

09:43.260 --> 09:46.450
They poisoned Si Lili.

09:46.490 --> 09:48.680
Do they mean to kill her on the way?

09:48.700 --> 09:50.280
She won't die.

09:50.460 --> 09:53.710
She is not the target. Someone else is!

09:53.730 --> 09:55.920
It's prepared for the little emperor of Beiqi?

09:58.410 --> 10:01.890
This plan is called Red Sleeve Edict.

10:02.370 --> 10:04.100
I'm afraid it's a death edict.

10:04.100 --> 10:06.210
After getting Yan Bingyun back,

10:06.460 --> 10:09.570
find a chance to kill Xiao En.

10:11.340 --> 10:12.440
You want me

10:12.460 --> 10:14.080
to kill Xiao En

10:14.140 --> 10:15.600
under the eyes of the Beiqi people?

10:15.850 --> 10:17.390
There doesn't seem to be anything else

10:17.410 --> 10:19.250
other than that.

10:22.370 --> 10:23.960
Kill the emperor and Xiao En

10:24.370 --> 10:27.400
in an alien state.

10:28.370 --> 10:30.330
This is thrilling enough.

10:31.460 --> 10:33.400
And I can tell you

10:33.660 --> 10:36.210
the Investigator's Office won't help you

10:36.490 --> 10:39.350
as it may become suspicious as a result.

10:39.370 --> 10:41.200
Your Majesty really flattered me.

10:41.220 --> 10:43.130
What else do you have to say?

10:43.490 --> 10:45.000
I do have a doubt.

10:45.020 --> 10:45.830
Say it!

10:45.850 --> 10:47.290
You can talk to me in the palace as well.

10:47.290 --> 10:48.760
Why do you choose here?

10:48.780 --> 10:50.390
This is different from the palace.

10:50.410 --> 10:51.530
We're in the monarch-subject relationship in palace,

10:51.530 --> 10:52.140
but here...

10:52.140 --> 10:53.370
What's the difference?

10:57.490 --> 10:59.280
Come back alive.

11:00.290 --> 11:02.700
What did you just say, Your Majesty?

11:02.700 --> 11:04.510
Remember to come back alive.

11:04.530 --> 11:05.460
It doesn't matter

11:05.460 --> 11:06.100
even if the mission fails

11:06.100 --> 11:07.270
as long as I can come back alive?

11:07.290 --> 11:09.720
Don't ask while knowing the answer.

11:10.930 --> 11:12.960
This is my order!

11:13.460 --> 11:14.960
Piss off!

11:52.050 --> 11:54.470
There is merely monarch-subject relationship in the palace.

11:54.490 --> 11:55.410
How different is it

11:55.410 --> 11:57.160
in Taiping Residence?

11:57.340 --> 11:58.890
You've met His Majesty?

11:59.050 --> 12:01.250
I felt like I've met a fake emperor.

12:01.460 --> 12:02.890
Do you think it's a bit difficult

12:02.930 --> 12:04.640
about the mission this time?

12:04.660 --> 12:05.510
Not really!

12:05.530 --> 12:06.920
Don't worry, Teacher.

12:08.460 --> 12:09.290
Initially, I wanted to go to Beiqi

12:09.290 --> 12:10.460
along with you.

12:10.460 --> 12:11.720
No!

12:12.780 --> 12:14.450
Head Chen has also said

12:15.260 --> 12:17.690
I have killed too many Beiqi agents.

12:18.220 --> 12:19.840
If I go with you,

12:19.970 --> 12:21.470
it may be bad for you.

12:21.490 --> 12:23.150
Just stay in the capital city for a rest.

12:23.170 --> 12:24.570
Wait for my return.

12:25.220 --> 12:26.800
Pay special attention to such a few people

12:26.820 --> 12:29.400
when you reach Beiqi.

12:30.020 --> 12:31.470
One is the

12:31.490 --> 12:34.150
Commander-in-chief of Embroidered
Uniform Guards, Shen Zhong.

12:34.170 --> 12:35.960
Head has told me about him.

12:36.410 --> 12:37.830
The other one is Ku He,

12:37.850 --> 12:39.890
the Great Master.

12:41.140 --> 12:43.080
I heard that

12:43.660 --> 12:45.440
he doesn't want Xiao En to return to Beiqi.

12:45.460 --> 12:47.250
Both of them are Beiqi people, aren't they?

12:48.410 --> 12:50.830
Guo Baokun and you are both Nanqing people.

12:50.850 --> 12:52.710
Do you like each other?

12:52.730 --> 12:54.160
Good point!

12:54.610 --> 12:55.530
But what can I do

12:55.530 --> 12:56.930
if the Great Master

12:56.930 --> 12:58.720
wants to plot against me?

12:59.170 --> 13:01.560
He'll respect his own identity.

13:01.580 --> 13:04.320
If he wants to stop Xiao En to return,

13:04.340 --> 13:06.770
he will send his disciples.

13:07.930 --> 13:09.250
Does he have a lot of disciples?

13:10.140 --> 13:11.520
None of them matters

13:11.610 --> 13:13.850
except the one

13:13.850 --> 13:15.450
named Haitang.

13:15.850 --> 13:17.140
That sounds like

13:17.140 --> 13:18.350
a lady's name.

13:18.370 --> 13:20.590
Haitang is also named as Haitang Duoduo.

13:20.610 --> 13:22.650
She is the last disciple of Ku He.

13:23.020 --> 13:23.880
She is

13:23.900 --> 13:25.960
a famous talent in Beiqi

13:26.050 --> 13:28.440
where the people respectfully call her the Saintess.

13:28.460 --> 13:29.800
So it is a lady!

13:29.820 --> 13:31.800
You're the poetic genius and she is the Saintess.

13:31.820 --> 13:33.320
That's tit for tat.

13:33.340 --> 13:35.710
She is said to be ranked as Ninth Dan.

13:35.730 --> 13:36.900
It's quite easy

13:36.900 --> 13:37.910
to become a Ninth Dan master, right?

13:37.930 --> 13:39.080
There are just too many!

13:39.100 --> 13:41.280
A Ninth Dan master is easy to defeat,

13:42.610 --> 13:45.220
but if Ku He really wants

13:45.220 --> 13:46.590
to stop Xiao En from going back

13:46.610 --> 13:49.130
and does it himself,

13:49.220 --> 13:50.810
we'll have to accept it.

13:53.170 --> 13:54.780
Teacher, you know really a lot

13:54.780 --> 13:56.210
about Beiqi.

13:56.260 --> 13:57.840
Don't flatter me!

13:58.610 --> 13:59.100
There is one more guy

13:59.100 --> 14:01.080
who is the general of Beiqi, Shangshan Hu.

14:01.100 --> 14:03.080
This guy resists the savages for a number of years

14:03.100 --> 14:04.440
and wins all the battles.

14:04.460 --> 14:06.510
Some said he is bad-tempered.

14:06.530 --> 14:09.510
Some said he is soft and humble.

14:09.530 --> 14:10.880
Isn't that contradictory?

14:10.900 --> 14:12.840
That's the strange part.

14:12.970 --> 14:15.250
Does he have dissociative disorders?

14:16.370 --> 14:18.650
Shangshan Hu is Xiao En's adopted son.

14:19.020 --> 14:20.510
He's been looking forward

14:20.530 --> 14:22.810
to the return of Xiao En.

14:22.930 --> 14:23.660
Then it's not likely for him

14:23.660 --> 14:24.660
to plot against me.

14:24.660 --> 14:26.760
After all, I'm escorting his adoptive father back.

14:26.780 --> 14:28.010
Yeah!

14:28.610 --> 14:30.960
He should not plot against you.

14:34.730 --> 14:36.150
Have you baked the meat?

14:36.170 --> 14:37.650
Where is my meat?

14:37.970 --> 14:38.760
Your Excellency,

14:38.780 --> 14:40.480
we have it prepared a long time back.

14:51.040 --> 14:54.230
=Shangshan Hu, Grand General of Beiqi=

15:08.220 --> 15:09.150
Grand General,

15:09.170 --> 15:10.830
we got message from Nanqing.

15:10.850 --> 15:11.640
The Nanqing mission

15:11.660 --> 15:13.330
is sending Mr. Xiao En back.

15:14.530 --> 15:15.710
We can't let my adoptive father

15:15.730 --> 15:17.650
fall in the hands of the throne.

15:18.140 --> 15:20.210
Let's meet them in the territory of Nanqing

15:20.260 --> 15:21.880
and take over him first.

15:21.900 --> 15:24.010
How do we deal with the escorting mission?

15:25.820 --> 15:26.710
Who is the leader?

15:26.730 --> 15:29.840
Fan Xian, the poetic genius of Nanqing.

15:31.140 --> 15:32.590
I haven't heard of him.

15:32.610 --> 15:34.000
Kill him when they come.

15:34.020 --> 15:35.330
Yes!

15:57.850 --> 15:58.800
Teacher,

15:58.820 --> 15:59.950
what's the family name of Shangshan Hu?

15:59.970 --> 16:01.780
Is it Shangshan

16:01.780 --> 16:03.480
or Shang?

16:08.410 --> 16:09.890
The mission is up there.

16:10.460 --> 16:11.920
I'll leave you for now.

16:14.020 --> 16:17.370
Sure! Please take a good rest to recover.

16:17.490 --> 16:19.770
Chen Pingping shouldn't have told you that.

16:20.850 --> 16:22.570
Let me give you some more information.

16:22.730 --> 16:23.780
That little emperor of Beiqi

16:23.780 --> 16:24.910
just took over the throne.

16:24.930 --> 16:26.520
The Empress Dowager hasn't handed over the power yet.

16:27.170 --> 16:29.120
There is already inkling between their fight for the throne.

16:29.140 --> 16:30.400
Got it!

16:30.530 --> 16:32.320
It's a good chance to take advantage

16:32.340 --> 16:34.250
from the battle between a mother and a son.

16:34.610 --> 16:36.020
I intend to ask you to escape

16:36.020 --> 16:37.480
while they're fighting.

16:37.820 --> 16:38.640
Do you want to

16:38.660 --> 16:39.610
get involved into

16:39.610 --> 16:40.340
the political affairs of Beiqi?

16:40.340 --> 16:41.350
No! No! No!

16:41.370 --> 16:43.130
I didn't mean it.

16:45.730 --> 16:46.920
Well...

16:49.170 --> 16:50.960
It's not easy

16:51.260 --> 16:53.650
to get infected with Si Lili's poison.

16:54.490 --> 16:56.030
It can only be infected

16:56.050 --> 16:57.690
when there are intimate contacts

16:58.170 --> 16:59.350
such as tongue kisses.

16:59.370 --> 17:00.920
You know that as well?

17:01.290 --> 17:03.680
It was I who compounded

17:03.700 --> 17:05.840
the Red Sleeve Edict poison.

17:07.580 --> 17:08.980
You have awesome skills, Teacher!

17:08.980 --> 17:10.930
The No. 1 poison expert in the world.

17:13.530 --> 17:14.340
What's this?

17:14.340 --> 17:16.320
The antidote to Si Lili's poison.

17:16.340 --> 17:18.320
It has a manual about its usage.

17:19.580 --> 17:22.720
I'm just afraid that you might not be able to hold it

17:23.220 --> 17:24.560
and get poisoned yourself.

17:24.580 --> 17:25.870
You can use this to save yourself.

17:25.890 --> 17:27.410
How can I get poisoned?

17:29.340 --> 17:30.910
What do you mean that I'm not able to hold it?

17:30.930 --> 17:32.500
Teacher, I'm a decent man.

17:32.500 --> 17:34.250
I don't have any dirty thoughts on her.

17:35.700 --> 17:37.770
You're a decent man.

17:39.250 --> 17:40.560
I'm leaving now.

17:41.530 --> 17:42.910
One final reminder.

17:42.930 --> 17:45.170
Don't lose your life.

17:45.380 --> 17:48.560
Otherwise, I'll go to the capital city of Beiqi myself

17:48.890 --> 17:50.220
and slaughter the whole city

17:50.220 --> 17:51.720
for you.

17:54.930 --> 17:56.370
Don't worry, Teacher.

17:56.580 --> 17:58.440
I'll surely come back alive.

18:14.580 --> 18:15.910
Why are you here?

18:15.930 --> 18:16.500
We already said goodbye

18:16.500 --> 18:17.890
at home, didn't we?

18:19.290 --> 18:21.170
I'm not here to say goodbye.

18:21.290 --> 18:22.990
I'm here to urge you

18:23.010 --> 18:25.050
because you become negligent recently.

18:25.100 --> 18:26.440
What do you mean?

18:26.500 --> 18:27.620
The book!

18:27.620 --> 18:29.560
You are very slow now with the book.

18:29.580 --> 18:30.580
Danbo Bookstore

18:30.580 --> 18:31.410
is in urgent need of your new chapters

18:31.410 --> 18:32.820
for the Red Mansions.

18:32.820 --> 18:33.770
If it weren���t for the poem anthology

18:33.770 --> 18:34.530
the other day,

18:34.530 --> 18:36.080
we would have nothing to publish now.

18:36.100 --> 18:37.910
I've been quite busy recently.

18:37.930 --> 18:38.770
I don't care!

18:38.770 --> 18:40.080
That's an excuse.

18:40.100 --> 18:41.380
There isn't much to do

18:41.380 --> 18:42.230
for your trip to Beiqi.

18:42.250 --> 18:43.380
Spare some time every day

18:43.380 --> 18:44.480
and finish a part.

18:44.500 --> 18:45.130
Once you finish,

18:45.130 --> 18:46.840
send it to me by post-horses.

18:46.860 --> 18:49.630
Write more about the romantic stuff

18:49.650 --> 18:51.200
like you love me but I don't love you.

18:51.220 --> 18:52.270
The ladies from wealthy and influential families

18:52.290 --> 18:53.440
like that.

18:53.460 --> 18:55.320
No wonder you followed me here.

18:56.010 --> 18:57.480
Brother, don't worry.

18:57.500 --> 18:59.720
I'll move to Wan'er's place tomorrow.

18:59.740 --> 19:00.510
Why?

19:00.530 --> 19:02.360
To protect my future sister-in-law for you.

19:02.380 --> 19:04.910
I'll stop her from seeing anyone else.

19:04.930 --> 19:06.720
That's outrageous.

19:07.410 --> 19:08.580
Shall I go or not?

19:08.580 --> 19:09.130
You should!

19:09.130 --> 19:10.620
Beat the hell out of those who ingratiate Wan'er.

19:10.620 --> 19:12.290
Sure, I got it!

19:12.340 --> 19:13.770
As the elder brother,

19:13.770 --> 19:15.320
you have set a wrong example.

19:15.340 --> 19:16.960
Let's call it expression of nature.

19:17.050 --> 19:18.380
You're about to visit Beiqi.

19:18.380 --> 19:20.050
Why are you still so naughty?

19:22.100 --> 19:24.360
These are my bodyguards.

19:24.380 --> 19:26.320
=Gao Da, Commander of Tiger guards of Nanqing=
All of them are state-of-the-art.

19:26.410 --> 19:27.360
They will go to Beiqi

19:27.380 --> 19:28.720
along with you this time.

19:31.250 --> 19:32.800
You keep so many guards

19:32.820 --> 19:34.480
as an Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue?

19:34.500 --> 19:36.100
Gao Da and the swordsmen under him

19:36.100 --> 19:37.320
are very reliable.

19:37.340 --> 19:39.200
You can entrust them with

19:39.220 --> 19:40.890
whatever you want to do.

19:41.530 --> 19:43.800
I'm at Your Excellency's service.

19:44.410 --> 19:46.270
How to spell your name?

19:46.290 --> 19:47.390
G-A-O,
(The name is the Chinese

19:47.410 --> 19:48.910
D-A!
translation of 'Gundam')

19:48.930 --> 19:50.680
I have long desired to know you.

19:53.050 --> 19:54.960
Your Excellency have heard of me before?

19:55.010 --> 19:56.360
I kept a small horse in Danzhou.

19:56.380 --> 19:57.560
It is named as Zaku.
(a type of robot from Mobile Suit Gundam)

19:57.580 --> 19:58.290
I'll arrange a meeting for you

19:58.290 --> 20:00.010
when I get the time.

20:00.100 --> 20:01.390
Do we need to take a detour

20:01.410 --> 20:02.750
to Danzhou?

20:02.770 --> 20:04.320
I mean next time.

20:04.340 --> 20:05.960
Alright! Forget about him.

20:05.980 --> 20:08.530
He usually behaves himself strangely.

20:09.500 --> 20:10.910
Take care of him

20:10.930 --> 20:12.390
during the trip.

20:12.410 --> 20:13.270
Sure!

20:13.290 --> 20:14.890
Wait outside the gate.

20:25.170 --> 20:27.010
Don't show off or take any risks.

20:27.220 --> 20:28.200
Just remember

20:28.220 --> 20:30.010
you have families in the capital city

20:30.860 --> 20:32.170
waiting for you to come back.

20:33.170 --> 20:34.480
Brother,

20:35.650 --> 20:37.720
drink up this bowl of farewell liquor.

20:38.290 --> 20:39.110
What are you doing?

20:39.130 --> 20:40.720
He's not going to a battlefield.

20:41.130 --> 20:42.650
I think it's pretty much like it.

22:13.410 --> 22:14.360
Let's go!

22:14.380 --> 22:15.800
Sure, Your Excellency!

23:15.740 --> 23:17.720
Watch the road. Don't get distracted.

23:22.580 --> 23:24.440
Stop the carriage! Take a break!

23:27.860 --> 23:29.680
Your Excellency,

23:29.700 --> 23:30.960
where are you going?

23:31.250 --> 23:32.750
You don't need to know it.

23:32.770 --> 23:34.200
Allow me to come along.

23:36.620 --> 23:37.750
I've got a nature's call.

23:37.770 --> 23:39.030
So have I.

23:39.050 --> 23:40.080
I want to poop.

23:40.100 --> 23:41.720
So do I.

23:42.580 --> 23:44.390
Your Excellency, do you want

23:44.410 --> 23:46.130
to quit from the trip?

23:46.170 --> 23:47.600
You are afraid to make any trouble

23:47.620 --> 23:49.250
so you want to escape?

23:50.530 --> 23:52.530
So in your eyes, I am a trouble?

23:53.890 --> 23:56.030
Your Excellency, if you are escaping,

23:56.050 --> 23:57.340
please bring me along.

23:57.340 --> 23:58.800
I don't want to go either.

23:59.010 --> 24:00.340
I'm wiser than them all.

24:00.340 --> 24:01.480
I know how to behave in delicate situations.

24:01.500 --> 24:02.170
Gao Da!

24:02.170 --> 24:03.410
Yes!

24:04.410 --> 24:05.600
Your Excellency!

24:05.700 --> 24:06.600
I'm going to answer the call of nature.

24:06.620 --> 24:07.530
Stay here for further command

24:07.530 --> 24:08.380
and watch the carriage.

24:08.380 --> 24:10.030
No one shall leave.

24:10.050 --> 24:11.320
Yes!

24:13.050 --> 24:14.410
Your Excellency!

24:34.740 --> 24:36.130
Uncle Wuzhu.

24:38.130 --> 24:39.360
According to what you said,

24:39.380 --> 24:41.080
I went to Taiping Residence.

24:41.130 --> 24:42.110
How was it?

24:42.130 --> 24:43.770
The defense is really strict.

24:51.650 --> 24:52.630
You didn't get in?

24:52.650 --> 24:53.990
I got in,

24:54.010 --> 24:55.510
but I'm afraid

24:55.530 --> 24:57.130
it's not possible

24:57.770 --> 24:58.870
to escape along with you.

24:58.890 --> 25:00.530
Did you get under water?

25:55.250 --> 25:57.290
Did you see the mechanism left by my mom?

26:00.010 --> 26:01.480
It's a bit wired.

26:02.250 --> 26:03.600
What is it like?

26:03.930 --> 26:05.750
When I jumped up into the sky,

26:05.770 --> 26:07.220
I found the stone

26:07.220 --> 26:08.650
is actually the key.

26:10.380 --> 26:11.890
It's hard to describe it clearly.

26:12.410 --> 26:13.100
I always feel that

26:13.100 --> 26:14.100
you're the only one

26:14.100 --> 26:15.320
in the world

26:16.100 --> 26:17.480
who can understand the mechanism

26:17.500 --> 26:20.050
left by your mom!

26:25.770 --> 26:26.620
You have to wait

26:26.620 --> 26:28.130
till I get back to the capital city.

26:28.620 --> 26:30.600
Do you really want to open that secret door?

26:31.010 --> 26:31.500
Didn't you say

26:31.500 --> 26:33.230
we'll be in grave danger

26:33.250 --> 26:35.200
once we know the truth?

26:36.100 --> 26:37.680
I know,

26:37.700 --> 26:38.990
but what mankind can't beat

26:39.010 --> 26:40.250
is the curiosity

26:40.250 --> 26:41.870
to the unknown.

26:41.890 --> 26:44.370
Anyway, curiosity kills the cat.

26:44.740 --> 26:46.010
Sure!

26:46.460 --> 26:47.050
What the lady left

26:47.050 --> 26:48.560
in the case

26:48.700 --> 26:49.910
are weapons, aren't they?

26:49.930 --> 26:51.200
Why don't you bring them to Beiqi?

26:51.220 --> 26:52.170
I left them at home.

26:52.170 --> 26:53.770
Take care of them for me.

26:55.250 --> 26:56.200
I'm also leaving.

26:56.220 --> 26:56.990
Where are you going?

26:57.010 --> 26:58.250
To the north.

26:58.460 --> 27:00.080
Are you going to Beiqi along with me?

27:00.100 --> 27:01.200
I'll go first.

27:01.220 --> 27:02.440
Why?

27:02.460 --> 27:04.320
Just now Fei Jie said

27:04.340 --> 27:06.720
Ku He will possibly plot against you.

27:07.500 --> 27:09.170
It's only a possibility.

27:09.770 --> 27:12.010
Why do you look for Ku He?

27:12.100 --> 27:13.320
To fight!

27:14.290 --> 27:15.360
Uncle...

27:15.380 --> 27:17.560
To beat him till he's not able to harm you.

27:17.580 --> 27:19.480
He is the Great Master!

27:20.500 --> 27:22.320
The Great Master is who I want to beat.

27:24.980 --> 27:27.890
That's really daring.

27:28.290 --> 27:29.840
I don't care about anyone

27:29.860 --> 27:31.390
under the level of Great Masters.

27:31.410 --> 27:33.480
I see! Leave them to me.

27:34.010 --> 27:35.960
So, we'll meet in Beiqi, right?

27:36.100 --> 27:37.560
I must drag down Ku He

27:37.580 --> 27:39.560
and therefore can't go to the capital of Beiqi.

27:39.740 --> 27:41.050
We won't meet then.

27:43.770 --> 27:45.370
Be safe!

27:54.050 --> 27:55.440
The last point.

27:56.130 --> 27:57.510
I seem to remember

27:57.530 --> 27:59.800
the name Xiao En.

27:59.890 --> 28:01.200
What do you mean?

28:01.220 --> 28:04.930
The lady used to travel with Xiao En.

28:05.170 --> 28:06.440
My mom?

28:06.460 --> 28:08.110
She also told me that

28:08.130 --> 28:10.080
she came to this world

28:10.100 --> 28:12.270
because of Xiao En.

28:12.290 --> 28:13.560
What else?

28:14.700 --> 28:16.410
That's all I can remember.

28:18.580 --> 28:20.530
So perhaps Xiao En knows

28:20.530 --> 28:22.250
the secrets of my mom.

28:22.650 --> 28:24.270
You can ask him yourself.

28:24.290 --> 28:26.290
But the order I got is to kill...

28:31.380 --> 28:35.250
But the order I got is to kill him.

28:51.460 --> 28:52.480
There you come, Your Excellency!

28:52.500 --> 28:53.150
What's up?

28:53.170 --> 28:54.320
Your Excellency,

28:55.340 --> 28:57.290
Where did you find this guy?

28:57.580 --> 28:59.050
You mean Wang Qinian?

28:59.100 --> 29:00.110
What's wrong with him?

29:00.130 --> 29:02.370
While the mission was distributing solid food,

29:03.130 --> 29:05.250
he stole the fruits in stock.

29:07.290 --> 29:09.990
He is sneaky-behaved and filthy and greedy in personality.

29:10.010 --> 29:12.530
Your Excellency, we can't keep people like this.

29:13.050 --> 29:15.250
I'll talk to him about this.

29:15.530 --> 29:17.270
Thank you for reminding me.

29:17.290 --> 29:18.320
Your Excellency,

29:18.340 --> 29:20.650
let me do it if you want to drive him away.

29:20.650 --> 29:21.960
OK!

29:21.980 --> 29:23.650
Go ahead with your business.

29:32.890 --> 29:34.130
Your Excellency,

29:34.740 --> 29:36.080
you are back.

29:39.100 --> 29:40.750
Are you going to eat

29:40.770 --> 29:41.840
the solid food distributed just now?

29:41.860 --> 29:43.080
No!

29:43.130 --> 29:45.720
Your Excellency,

29:46.130 --> 29:48.680
do you know what I found?

29:49.980 --> 29:51.250
What?

29:54.010 --> 29:55.480
I found

29:55.700 --> 29:58.030
there are fresh fruits

29:58.050 --> 30:00.170
in the luggage cart of the mission.

30:00.410 --> 30:02.480
They are delivered here by post-horses.

30:04.050 --> 30:05.720
I've taken some for you.

30:07.980 --> 30:09.270
Wang Qinian,

30:09.290 --> 30:11.390
I am the leader of the mission.

30:11.410 --> 30:13.390
Do I need to steal the fruits?

30:13.410 --> 30:15.580
Your Excellency,

30:15.580 --> 30:17.230
these fruits are kept

30:17.250 --> 30:19.560
with ice cubes.

30:19.930 --> 30:21.200
They are gifts

30:21.220 --> 30:23.530
we send to Beiqi, sort of.

30:23.620 --> 30:24.960
But they are more and more uncommon

30:24.980 --> 30:27.440
as we go further and further into the north.

30:27.460 --> 30:28.480
You just took the gifts

30:28.500 --> 30:29.840
between two states.

30:29.930 --> 30:32.170
Nobody will count them.

30:32.170 --> 30:34.530
It won't be detected if only we take a few.

30:35.100 --> 30:37.600
It's not a big deal

30:37.620 --> 30:38.750
to take a few fruits

30:38.770 --> 30:40.720
given all the hardship on the way.

30:42.340 --> 30:43.390
No, I won't take them!

30:43.410 --> 30:44.600
Thank you!

30:52.410 --> 30:53.130
It's alright!

30:53.130 --> 30:54.650
Go! Go!

30:54.890 --> 30:56.410
Go!

31:04.050 --> 31:07.560
Your Excellency, take some!

31:10.820 --> 31:12.630
Don't feel sorry for it.

31:12.650 --> 31:14.770
I'll get you a few more.

31:15.460 --> 31:16.380
Don't worry.

31:16.380 --> 31:17.770
I'll be your sentry.

31:18.410 --> 31:20.930
It's not easy to stay in this position.

31:39.380 --> 31:41.370
Go! Go!

31:49.770 --> 31:51.770
There is not much time left. Hurry up with it!

31:54.650 --> 31:57.530
Dad! Dad!

32:03.500 --> 32:05.150
What are you doing here?

32:05.170 --> 32:06.800
I was worried that you'll suffer.

32:06.820 --> 32:07.990
This is insane!

32:08.010 --> 32:08.770
I told you to break off

32:08.770 --> 32:09.960
all relations with me.

32:09.980 --> 32:11.030
Dad!

32:11.050 --> 32:13.130
Did they beat you or insult you?

32:13.170 --> 32:15.150
I am an official anyway.

32:15.170 --> 32:16.700
They treated me well.

32:16.700 --> 32:17.530
You don't need to worry.

32:17.530 --> 32:18.510
Go!

32:18.530 --> 32:19.630
Dad!

32:19.650 --> 32:20.930
I tried to bribe a lot of people,

32:20.930 --> 32:22.560
but got refused.

32:22.580 --> 32:24.340
Every one of them prevaricated

32:24.340 --> 32:25.720
and refused to help.

32:25.740 --> 32:28.440
Silver won't help. It's useless to try.

32:29.700 --> 32:32.960
Dad, I've hired a bunch of killers.

32:32.980 --> 32:35.050
They are the best of their kind.

32:35.740 --> 32:37.170
What are you doing?

32:40.130 --> 32:42.510
Fan Xian went to Beiqi with a mission.

32:42.530 --> 32:44.270
That's a perfect chance.

32:44.290 --> 32:45.580
I'll follow behind him

32:45.580 --> 32:46.960
and initiate an attack

32:46.980 --> 32:47.930
to take his life

32:47.930 --> 32:48.800
when they get to the wilderness

32:48.820 --> 32:50.480
so as to retaliate for you.

32:51.130 --> 32:53.960
You must stop that.

32:55.010 --> 32:56.800
Dad, don't worry.

32:56.820 --> 32:58.530
I've read a lot of book on the art of war

32:58.530 --> 33:00.030
and studied a lot of examples of battles.

33:00.050 --> 33:01.840
They give me a lot of insights.

33:01.860 --> 33:03.030
Now it looks like

33:03.050 --> 33:04.340
I have the potential

33:04.340 --> 33:06.080
to become a good general in the world.

33:07.620 --> 33:09.320
That's not possible.

33:09.340 --> 33:10.840
Don't do silly things.

33:10.860 --> 33:12.220
This is not silly.

33:12.220 --> 33:14.650
The patrol is coming. Leave now!

33:15.500 --> 33:17.080
Dad, wait for my news.

33:17.100 --> 33:19.150
No, don't do that.

33:19.170 --> 33:20.930
It's dangerous to you.

33:31.380 --> 33:32.580
Are you a beggar?

33:32.580 --> 33:34.200
Do I look like one?

33:40.980 --> 33:42.440
Are you a beggar?

33:49.290 --> 33:50.800
Beggar...

33:54.130 --> 33:55.840
Excuse me! Excuse me!

34:12.820 --> 34:14.560
Are you a beggar?

34:14.580 --> 34:19.240
I'm not only a beggar, but also a cook.

34:19.900 --> 34:21.650
I'm Zhao Da!

34:23.490 --> 34:24.640
Are they all here?

34:24.660 --> 34:25.820
Set off now.

34:25.820 --> 34:26.840
Fan Xian has already gone out of town.

34:26.860 --> 34:29.840
Wait a moment, Young Master! They are on the way.

34:30.010 --> 34:30.900
I told you to gather them here

34:30.900 --> 34:32.560
in the capital city!

34:32.580 --> 34:35.970
It's harvest time in the countryside.
They will come after that.

34:38.180 --> 34:39.320
Well...

34:45.660 --> 34:48.000
Take a seat! Sit down!

34:51.290 --> 34:52.560
Young Master,

34:53.380 --> 34:54.650
all of us are veterans

34:54.690 --> 34:57.320
retired from the frontiers.

34:57.530 --> 35:00.280
We have farm work only after we got back.

35:00.450 --> 35:01.580
Generally,

35:01.580 --> 35:03.950
we'd also help with

35:03.970 --> 35:05.320
weddings and funerals

35:05.340 --> 35:06.950
so that we have sustenance.

35:06.970 --> 35:09.030
But don't worry, Your Excellency!

35:09.050 --> 35:10.840
We're most adept

35:11.770 --> 35:13.730
in murdering and robbing

35:13.730 --> 35:14.660
without any mistakes.

35:14.660 --> 35:15.840
Fan Xian has already gone!

35:15.860 --> 35:17.760
It's a sure thing!

35:17.820 --> 35:19.190
The mission can't travel fast.

35:19.210 --> 35:20.930
We can catch up with them
even if we set off a few days later.

35:22.620 --> 35:23.890
Are you sure?

35:29.010 --> 35:30.840
The Patrol Division has to stop from here.

35:30.860 --> 35:31.750
We'll have to rely on ourselves

35:31.770 --> 35:33.520
further to the north.

35:33.970 --> 35:36.080
There shouldn't be any danger

35:36.100 --> 35:37.930
in our own territory.

35:40.770 --> 35:43.190
But Xiao En is infamous.

35:43.210 --> 35:44.230
Your Excellency,

35:44.250 --> 35:46.160
we must beware of him all the time.

35:46.180 --> 35:47.930
I poison him every day.

35:48.340 --> 35:49.820
It's better to have someone

35:49.820 --> 35:50.920
watching over him all the time.

35:50.940 --> 35:52.360
But I have to look out for the surroundings.

35:52.380 --> 35:53.160
My guards fear him

35:53.180 --> 35:54.640
as much as they fear tigers

35:54.660 --> 35:55.640
and dare not to approach.

35:55.660 --> 35:57.730
Totally understandable.

35:59.820 --> 36:01.120
By the way, Your Excellency,

36:01.140 --> 36:02.530
I saw Wang Qinian

36:02.530 --> 36:04.000
stealing fruits again.

36:05.140 --> 36:06.970
You bumped into him again?

36:09.940 --> 36:11.510
I watch over him all the time.

36:11.530 --> 36:13.450
Your Excellency, we can't let him stay.

36:13.450 --> 36:14.710
If Your Excellency feels embarrassed,

36:14.730 --> 36:17.670
I can be the bad guy and drive him away.

36:17.690 --> 36:19.080
Not necessary!

36:19.860 --> 36:21.000
Why?

36:21.450 --> 36:23.560
Actually, all of his behaviors of such

36:23.580 --> 36:25.190
are an illusion.

36:25.210 --> 36:26.380
He is a first-class

36:26.380 --> 36:27.190
warrior.

36:27.210 --> 36:28.600
Brave and perseverant!

36:46.010 --> 36:47.190
Is that true?

36:47.210 --> 36:48.760
That's...

36:48.820 --> 36:50.270
To be frank,

36:50.290 --> 36:51.320
I'm also worried that

36:51.340 --> 36:52.120
there will be accident

36:52.140 --> 36:53.800
to leave Xiao En alone

36:53.820 --> 36:54.920
in the carriage.

36:54.940 --> 36:56.270
As soon as I said that,

36:56.290 --> 36:57.880
Wang Qinian volunteered

36:57.900 --> 36:59.050
to take the same carriage with Xiao En

36:59.050 --> 37:00.880
for the rest of the journey

37:00.900 --> 37:02.320
so as to set an example for the mission.

37:09.970 --> 37:10.940
Did he really say that?

37:10.940 --> 37:12.320
Absolutely!

37:25.250 --> 37:26.690
Warrior Wang,

37:30.010 --> 37:31.800
I'm sorry.

37:32.450 --> 37:33.510
For what?

37:33.530 --> 37:35.210
I have been misled at the start

37:35.210 --> 37:37.370
by the illusions you put up.

37:37.490 --> 37:39.000
Now it seems

37:39.290 --> 37:41.840
you're the true hero.

37:43.340 --> 37:45.170
I'm flattered!

37:46.140 --> 37:48.080
Xiao En killed people massively

37:48.100 --> 37:49.650
in a cruel and ruthless manner.

37:49.940 --> 37:51.920
He is a real devil on earth.

37:51.940 --> 37:54.030
He is indeed unforgiveable.

37:54.050 --> 37:55.420
You are the only one

37:55.420 --> 37:57.000
who has no fear towards him.

37:58.900 --> 38:00.950
How can you tell that?

38:00.970 --> 38:01.660
Your voluntary move

38:01.660 --> 38:03.470
is no different from

38:03.490 --> 38:04.880
feeding yourself to a tiger.

38:04.900 --> 38:07.800
I truly admire it.

38:07.820 --> 38:09.180
I'm flattered!

38:09.180 --> 38:10.120
From now on,

38:10.140 --> 38:10.660
we are sworn brothers

38:10.660 --> 38:12.230
through thick and thin.

38:12.250 --> 38:13.930
Should you have any misfortune,

38:14.340 --> 38:16.080
I'll surely kill Xiao En

38:16.100 --> 38:17.930
to avenge you.

38:29.290 --> 38:30.730
Your Excellency,

38:31.140 --> 38:34.080
did this guy take the poisonous mushroom?

38:34.180 --> 38:35.950
Actually, he bumped into

38:35.970 --> 38:37.370
your stealing of the fruits.

38:38.180 --> 38:40.890
And he still admires me?

38:41.290 --> 38:42.270
Then,

38:42.290 --> 38:45.280
I kind of helped you out with a few good words.

39:06.490 --> 39:07.890
Mr. Xiao,

39:08.100 --> 39:09.880
I'll stay with you

39:09.900 --> 39:12.080
from today onwards.

39:12.100 --> 39:13.750
I got some warm water for you

39:13.770 --> 39:17.130
for a comfortable face wash.

39:43.250 --> 39:44.800
Do you think

39:44.940 --> 39:46.560
it will work

39:46.580 --> 39:48.970
if I kidnap you as a hostage

39:49.420 --> 39:50.760
to threaten that young guy?

39:53.820 --> 39:55.210
Mr. Xiao,

39:55.490 --> 39:57.710
since they assigned me here,

39:57.730 --> 39:58.990
it means

39:59.010 --> 40:01.380
I'm a person

40:01.380 --> 40:02.510
of little importance.

40:02.530 --> 40:03.800
Right?

40:04.380 --> 40:06.230
Why would the lords

40:06.250 --> 40:06.900
out there

40:06.900 --> 40:08.800
care about my life?

40:17.210 --> 40:19.800
Let me clean your face.

40:20.010 --> 40:21.450
Do you massage?

40:24.340 --> 40:26.520
You want massage?

40:47.290 --> 40:49.170
Aren't you afraid of me?

40:50.380 --> 40:53.520
Your reputation is widely-spread.

40:53.820 --> 40:55.600
Of course, I'm afraid.

40:56.050 --> 40:59.170
What if I kill you?

41:04.050 --> 41:06.240
His Excellency Fan is very rich.

41:06.620 --> 41:09.670
My wife and daughter

41:09.690 --> 41:12.560
will live a good life.

41:18.730 --> 41:20.240
What's your name?
(What are you screaming for?)

41:20.730 --> 41:21.880
I didn't scream!

41:21.900 --> 41:23.560
I didn't!

41:24.490 --> 41:26.970
I mean what's your name?

41:30.770 --> 41:32.930
My name is...

41:33.140 --> 41:34.970
Wang Qinian.

41:36.620 --> 41:38.450
Wang Qinian!

41:39.050 --> 41:40.320
I got it.

41:40.340 --> 41:41.970
Come on! This side.

41:42.420 --> 41:44.130
Here. This side.

43:16.360 --> 43:19.940
In the river of history,

43:19.960 --> 43:23.430
time goes round and round.

43:26.240 --> 43:29.580
Memories about the former and present lives

43:29.600 --> 43:33.670
join each other in an endless way.

43:35.560 --> 43:38.180
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:38.200 --> 43:40.440
one season follows another in a flash,

43:40.440 --> 43:42.940
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:42.960 --> 43:44.560
I just can't give up

43:44.560 --> 43:47.900
to be with you for my whole life.

43:47.920 --> 43:53.390
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:54.640 --> 43:57.190
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:57.480 --> 43:59.520
Year after year in the wandering,

43:59.520 --> 44:02.180
I count the remaining years.

44:02.200 --> 44:04.380
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:04.400 --> 44:06.390
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:06.680 --> 44:09.070
I never feel regretful.

44:09.120 --> 44:10.480
In such a chaotic world,

44:10.480 --> 44:13.460
I still miss you as ever.

44:13.480 --> 44:16.430
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:16.720 --> 44:18.780
With a gentle heart,

44:18.800 --> 44:21.460
I cherish our remaining years.

44:21.480 --> 44:23.000
Even though we have to go through

44:23.000 --> 44:25.510
all the hardships along the journey,

44:25.640 --> 44:32.830
you always stay by my side,

44:32.920 --> 44:35.590
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:35.880 --> 44:37.960
Year after year in the wandering,

44:37.960 --> 44:40.620
I count the remaining years.

44:40.640 --> 44:42.780
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:42.800 --> 44:45.030
even though we end up the destiny,

44:45.240 --> 44:47.420
I never feel regretful.

44:47.440 --> 44:48.840
In such a chaotic world,

44:48.840 --> 44:51.900
I still miss you as ever.

44:51.920 --> 44:55.030
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:55.120 --> 44:57.260
With a gentle heart,

44:57.280 --> 44:59.980
I cherish our remaining years.

45:00.000 --> 45:01.440
Even though we have to go through

45:01.440 --> 45:04.100
all the hardships along the journey,

45:04.120 --> 45:12.880
you always stay by my side...
